-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §57 שקט תעשייתי: in the agreement's term,
-- neither party, nor any of its units, takes strike or lock-out action,
-- in full or in part, or any other organised disruption of work, against
-- the other, on the matters the agreement settles.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-3`

§ `57 שקט תעשייתי`

DECLARE `Oz section 57 action` IS ONE OF
    `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work against the other party`

-- ¶1: in the agreement's term (§3, to 31.12.2016), on the matters it
-- settles, neither the employers nor the organisation — "או יחידה
-- מיחידותיו": a unit of either is the party — takes such action against
-- the other. Outside the term, or on another matter, the section forbids
-- nothing.
@ref akn:art_57/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `a matter the agreement settles` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz section 57 action`
DECIDE `industrial peace under section 57` d `a matter the agreement settles` IS
    IF `in the Oz agreement's period` d AND `a matter the agreement settles`
    THEN (PARTY `the employer`
          SHANT `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work against the other party`)
         RAND
         (PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
          SHANT `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work against the other party`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

#ASSERT `industrial peace under section 57` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2017) TRUE EQUALS FULFILLED
#ASSERT `industrial peace under section 57` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014) FALSE EQUALS FULFILLED
